    <string name="help_installed_version">Installed version: %1$s</string>
    <string-array name="help_features">
        <item>Choose your club and see its details: board, contacts and location on the map.</item>
        <item>Use the icon Home: reorder icons by dragging, hide the ones you don\'t use and pick a background.</item>
        <item>Browse Events and Calendar with tournaments and appointments from every club, with a countdown.</item>
        <item>Pre-register for tournaments, withdraw, see who has entered and read the tournament notice.</item>
        <item>In \"My tournaments\" follow pairings, results and standings almost in real time, with an alert when a new round is published.</item>
        <item>If you organise tournaments, \"Tournament management\" lets you generate and publish rounds, enter results and handle standings and prizes.</item>
